# SKARN, THE RAT KING — the giant_rat construction at BOSS scale: heavier, mangier, darker,
# with ssirath's GOLD CROWN technique on the skull and fiercer eyeshine. A LEAN body with a
# ROUNDED/ARCHED SPINE (coiled to propel itself at you — from above: a tense narrow capsule
# with a dark spine ridge and gathered haunches), DARKER STRIPES in the fur (dorsal ridge +
# flank striations), pinned-back ears, red eyeshine, bared incisors over a dark gape, clawed
# forepaws. Whip tail trails DOWN (may overhang). FRONT=UP.
# Techniques: lean-capsule mass + dark DORSAL-RIDGE stroke + flank striation strokes =
# the menacing-animal recipe (posture + fur, reusable for jackal/wolf kin).
#
# --- ENHANCE (fur): same upgrade as giant_rat.draw — value-gradient mass + broken-edge
# tufts + curved clumped flank ribbons + dark gaps (ref assets/sprites/ref/fur). As the BOSS
# it can carry MORE of it: mangier, deeper value range (radial=72,52,40>40,26,20), heavier
# dark-gap occlusion + more ragged edge strays than the common rat — fur is a menace cue here.
# Source for assets/sprites/skarn_rat_king.png.
size 256x256
Background transparent

# whip tail first (under the body) — thick base, hard S-curve
name tail
Poly (0.50,0.66)@8 (0.61,0.80)@4.5 (0.49,0.91)@2.5 (0.34,0.985)@1.5 stroke=148,112,102

# body — LEAN tense capsule, spine arched: narrow flanks, the mass gathered forward
name haunches
Circle (0.50,0.585) r=0.132 rgb=64,44,34
name midbody
Circle (0.50,0.470) r=0.142 rgb=64,44,34
name shoulders
Circle (0.50,0.375) r=0.132 rgb=64,44,34

# gathered haunch bulges — the hind legs coiled under, ready to spring
name haunchL
Circle (0.408,0.620) r=0.060 rgb=56,38,30
name haunchR
Circle (0.592,0.620) r=0.060 rgb=56,38,30

# the ROUNDED SPINE — a dark dorsal ridge down the midline (the arch, seen from above),
# running INTO the skull so head and body read as one animal
name spine
Poly (0.50,0.300)@6 (0.50,0.460)@11 (0.50,0.600)@7 (0.50,0.675)@4 stroke=56,36,26

# darker fur STRIPES — angled striations along the flanks
name stripes
Line (0.435,0.415) - (0.392,0.480) w=3
Line (0.452,0.475) - (0.408,0.545) w=3
Line (0.448,0.545) - (0.420,0.610) w=2
Line (0.565,0.415) - (0.608,0.480) w=3
Line (0.548,0.475) - (0.592,0.545) w=3
Line (0.552,0.545) - (0.580,0.610) w=2

# clawed forepaws — splayed beside the muzzle (the lunge)
name pawL
Circle (0.405,0.272) r=0.036 rgb=66,44,32
Poly (0.386,0.244) (0.374,0.200) (0.402,0.238) rgb=200,188,160
Poly (0.402,0.238) (0.400,0.194) (0.418,0.236) rgb=200,188,160
Poly (0.418,0.236) (0.430,0.198) (0.434,0.242) rgb=200,188,160
name pawR
Circle (0.595,0.272) r=0.036 rgb=66,44,32
Poly (0.614,0.244) (0.626,0.200) (0.598,0.238) rgb=200,188,160
Poly (0.598,0.238) (0.600,0.194) (0.582,0.236) rgb=200,188,160
Poly (0.582,0.236) (0.570,0.198) (0.566,0.242) rgb=200,188,160

# head — emerges FROM the shoulder mass, never bolted on: a SKULL circle bridges the joint
# (tone between body and muzzle), the muzzle wedge's base corners are BURIED inside it, and
# the spine ridge (above) runs into the skull to tie body and head together.
name skull
Circle (0.50,0.340) r=0.100 rgb=54,36,28
name muzzle
Poly (0.418,0.360) (0.582,0.360) (0.50,0.140) rgb=46,30,24

# ears — PINNED BACK: angular, swept from the skull sides (aggression)
name earL
Poly (0.458,0.318) (0.372,0.285) (0.436,0.362) rgb=50,30,22
name earR
Poly (0.542,0.318) (0.628,0.285) (0.564,0.362) rgb=50,30,22

# THE CROWN — a gold ring on the skull (the Rat King), points forward
name crown
Circle (0.50,0.330) r=0.052 rgb=212,172,58
Circle (0.50,0.330) r=0.034 rgb=54,36,28
Poly (0.500,0.252) (0.514,0.292) (0.486,0.292) rgb=212,172,58
Poly (0.444,0.272) (0.472,0.298) (0.448,0.312) rgb=212,172,58
Poly (0.556,0.272) (0.528,0.298) (0.552,0.312) rgb=212,172,58

# eyes — small, mean, RED eyeshine
name eyes
Circle (0.472,0.296) r=0.013 rgb=120,16,12
Circle (0.528,0.296) r=0.013 rgb=120,16,12
Circle (0.475,0.291) r=0.005 rgb=255,60,40
Circle (0.525,0.291) r=0.005 rgb=255,60,40

# the gape — dark open mouth at the muzzle tip, incisors bared OVER it
name gape
Poly (0.476,0.212) (0.524,0.212) (0.500,0.156) rgb=28,14,10
name incisors
Poly (0.470,0.218) (0.486,0.092) (0.500,0.212) rgb=214,196,140
Poly (0.500,0.212) (0.514,0.092) (0.530,0.218) rgb=214,196,140

# bristly whiskers
name whiskers
Line (0.464,0.236) - (0.322,0.176) w=1
Line (0.468,0.258) - (0.304,0.246) w=1
Line (0.536,0.236) - (0.678,0.176) w=1
Line (0.532,0.258) - (0.696,0.246) w=1
